:''This article is about the enemy. For the Cat Unit, see [[Eggy Cat (Rare Cat)]].''
'''Easter Egg Cat''' is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Eggy Cat Awakens!]] He was added in [[Version 12.2 Update|Version 12.2]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Easter Egg Cat
|image = E 635.png
|first appearance = [[Eggy Cat Awakens!|Eggy Cat Awakens！]]
|money drop = 1,800¢ - 7,110¢
}}

==Enemy==
Easter Egg Cat behaves like a weaker enemy [[Crazed Cat (Enemy)|Crazed Cat]] that exchanges raw stats for an irritating guaranteed [[Slow]] and piercing [[Omni Strike|Omni Strikes]].

==Strategy==
:''See [[Eggy Cat Awakens!]] for strategies.''

